"highlightText": "", "language": "english", "persons": [], "text": "On CNBC's \"Mad Money Lightning Round\" , Jim Cramer said that Carnival Corp (NYSE: CCL ) is good, but Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd (NYSE: NCLH ) has better growth.\nCramer can't understand how can Manitowoc Company Inc (NYSE: MTW ) trade so low. He isn't a buyer of the stock.\nTootsie Roll Industries, Inc. (NYSE: TR ) is going to stay at its current price level, thinks Cramer. He can't recommend a stock on a takeover basis and he doesn't see its earnings exploding.\nIt doesn't make sense to Cramer that GreenSky Inc (NASDAQ: GSKY ) is trading so low. He needs to do more work on the stock.\nCramer said Universal Display Corporation (NASDAQ: OLED ) falls and rallies with Apple Inc. (NASDAQ: AAPL ). He added that it's too hard for him these days.\n ", "external_links": ["https://www.benzinga.com/stock/gsky#NASDAQ", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/tr#NYSE", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/oled#NASDAQ", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/aapl#NASDAQ", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/mtw#NYSE", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/ccl#NYSE", "http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/nclh#NYSE", "https://www.cnbc.com/video/2018/08/13/cramers-lightning-round-bet-on-norwegian-cruise-line-not-carnival.html"], "published": "2018-08-14T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-08-14T19:33:20.010+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}